## RED/GREEN And Blocker Remediation

- C25 RED coverage was added for contracts, persistence, API, CLI, Mission Control, router wiring, raw SQL hardening, status URLs, and avatar run scope.
- RED logs include `c25-red-20260903T203905Z.log`, `c25-red-expanded-20260903T210944Z.log`, `c25-avatar-run-scope-red-20260903T213643Z.log`, `c25-raw-sql-hardening-red-20260904T000000Z.log`, and `c25-status-url-red-20260904T000000Z.log`.
